ED crystal film screen can be directly attached to the glass curtain wall, and it is integrated with the building from the appearance, no affect the original style of the building, does not affect the indoor lighting, and the screen is invisible when it is not playing, and it is invisible when viewed from a distance. These features have obvious technical advantages in the field of construction media.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke \" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"C9DxTc \">The transparency of the LED crystal film screen is very high, the light transmittance is as high as 97%, and it can present a bright color picture, while the viewing angle is wide, creating an excellent visual experience for users. Crystal film screens can be applied in a variety of places. All the features can not only facilitate users, but also explore new market blue oceans for LED display applications. As transparent display technology is recognized by more people, various LED transparent crystal screens are widely used in aerospace, commercial buildings, shopping malls, and luxury and jewelry chain stores, such as glass windows, merchandise display cabinets and vehicle displays.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-9ba13cc elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"9ba13cc\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-1f27527\" data-id=\"1f27527\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor